<title>USA: Vornado Realty names Fascitelli president.</title>
<headline>Vornado Realty names Fascitelli president.</headline>
<dateline>SADDLE BROOK, N.J. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vornado Realty Trust said Monday that it appointed Michael Fascitelli as the company's new president as well as a member of its board.  </p>
<p>Fascitelli was formerly the real estate partner at Goldman Sachs and prior to that, a consultant at McKinsey &amp; Co, Vornado said in a release.</p>
<p>Fascitelli has also been elected a director of Alexander's Inc, receiving an option for 350,000 shares of common stock, Vornado added.</p>
